<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Npm on cesun.life</title><link>https://example.org/tags/npm/</link><description>Recent content in Npm on cesun.life</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Aug 2023 06:51:10 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://example.org/tags/npm/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>The npm Ecosystem</title><link>https://example.org/npm-ecosystem/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Aug 2023 06:51:10 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://example.org/npm-ecosystem/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;npm is the package manager distributed with Node.js. It installs packages, runs project scripts, publishes packages to registries, and records dependency resolutions so a team can reproduce an application build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="package-metadata"&gt;
 Package Metadata
 &lt;a href="#package-metadata" class="heading-anchor"&gt;
 &lt;span&gt;#&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every npm project is described by &lt;code&gt;package.json&lt;/code&gt;. Its most important fields identify the package, define scripts, and declare dependencies:&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;div class="jose-wrapper"&gt;
 &lt;div class="jose-tools"&gt; &lt;span&gt;json&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;button&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;/div&gt;

 &lt;div class="jose-inner"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;{
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;example-service&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;private&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;type&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;module&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;scripts&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;test&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;node --test&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;,
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;start&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;node src/server.js&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; },
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;dependencies&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;fastify&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;^5.0.0&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; },
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;devDependencies&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;typescript&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;^5.0.0&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; },
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;engines&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;#34;node&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;: &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;gt;=20&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;dependencies&lt;/code&gt; are needed in production. &lt;code&gt;devDependencies&lt;/code&gt; support development, testing, or builds. A package marked &lt;code&gt;private: true&lt;/code&gt; cannot accidentally be published.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>